  "stem": "No more facts are given. What is true about “It may snow tonight” and “It might snow tonight”?",
  "options": [
    "May always says that snow will come.",
    "Might always says that snow cannot come.",
    "Only may can talk about tonight.",
    "Both say snow is possible; neither gives a number."
  ],
  "answerIndex": 3,
  "optionRationales": [
    {
      "optionIndex": 0,
      "isCorrect": false,
      "reason": "may 沒有固定等於六成的語意規則。"
    },
    {
      "optionIndex": 1,
      "isCorrect": false,
      "reason": "might 表示可能，不等於不可能。"
    },
    {
      "optionIndex": 2,
      "isCorrect": false,
      "reason": "may 與 might 都能配合 tonight 談未來可能。"
    },
    {
      "optionIndex": 3,
      "isCorrect": true,
      "reason": "缺乏其他情境時，兩者都可表不確定，不能硬換算固定比例。"
